   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Summer is the perfect time to explore and enjoy cannabis, with longer days, warm nights, and a more relaxed lifestyle. Whether you're planning a beach day, a barbecue with friends, or simply lounging in the sun, choosing the right strain can enhance your summer experience. Here are some of the best cannabis strains to enjoy during the summer season.",
    "html": "Summer is the perfect time to explore and enjoy cannabis, with longer days, warm nights, and a more relaxed lifestyle. Whether you're planning a beach day, a barbecue with friends, or simply lounging in the sun, choosing the right strain can enhance your summer experience. Here are some of the best cannabis strains to enjoy during the summer season."
   },
   {
    "t": "h3",
    "text": "1. Sour Diesel"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Sour Diesel is a classic strain renowned for its energizing and uplifting effects. This sativa-dominant strain has a pungent, diesel-like aroma with a hint of citrus. Sour Diesel is perfect for summer days when you want to stay active and engaged. Its stimulating effects can help you feel more social and enthusiastic, making it ideal for outdoor adventures or social gatherings.",
