    "t": "h3",
    "text": "2. Tangie"
   },
   {
    "t": "p",
    "text": "Tangie is a vibrant, citrus-flavored strain that's a favorite for summer. This sativa-dominant hybrid offers a refreshing tangerine aroma and a euphoric, creative high. Tangie is great for those who want to infuse their summer activities with a burst of creativity and joy. Whether you’re hitting the beach or exploring new trails, Tangie can make the experience more enjoyable.",
