    "text": "Blue Dream is a well-balanced hybrid that provides a gentle, relaxing high while maintaining mental clarity. Its sweet blueberry aroma and flavor make it a summer favorite. Blue Dream is versatile and can be enjoyed during both relaxing evenings and active days. It’s particularly good for unwinding after a day of fun in the sun or for enjoying a laid-back summer evening.",
